      "message": "[error] Line 7: 🔴 Hard-coding `VCPKG_TARGET_TRIPLET` to `x64-windows-static-md-release` makes the vcpkg path effectively x64+release-only and can break Debug or non-x64 Windows builds. Prefer leaving triplet selection to the caller/toolchain, or set this only as a fallback when undefined and aligned with `CMAKE_VS_PLATFORM_NAME`/configuration.",
