      "message": "It is a CACHE default, so -DVCPKG_TARGET_TRIPLET\u003d... overrides it. It matches what the MSVC build supports: CMAKE_CONFIGURATION_TYPES is forced to Release and the MSVC block is x64-only, same as the pywinmake contrib. (Moved to contrib/vcpkg/settings.cmake later in the stack.)",
