      "writtenOn": "2026-10-06T19:37:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "[warning] Line 701: 🟡 `find_program(PKG_CONFIG_EXECUTABLE NAMES pkgconf pkg-config REQUIRED)` searches the global `PATH`, so on Windows it can accidentally pick an unrelated `pkg-config` (e.g. MSYS) instead of the vcpkg-host tool, producing mixed include/lib flags. Constrain lookup to the vcpkg host-tools location (or use explicit `HINTS`/`PATHS` with `NO_DEFAULT_PATH` before a fallback) so pkg-config resolution stays toolchain-consistent.",
      "revId": "56587db7e4ccd710bf41f6dab66e0687a1bb6194",
      "serverId": "1e26b4c1-6b8c-47ff-9df7-501b633d3b5a"
